{"type":"text","timestamp":1790457956598,"sessionID":"ses_f20683e39ffel73iJ85nEayejM","part":{"id":"prt_0df9c48e3001LOHQoZAcjDnge1","messageID":"msg_0df9b94f8001IQnz3r1sE3FvMA","sessionID":"ses_f20683e39ffel73iJ85nEayejM","type":"text","text":"The render works and highlights are visible. Let me zoom into each coin position to verify tight coverage. Screen positions are transformed by the Level node's offset (55.5, 5) and scale 0.95.","time":{"start":1790457956579,"end":1790457956583},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_aa9052d2d0594c14aefe81a30bf9258e_msg"}}}}
